    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1733585341\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1733585341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1733585341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a colony simulator with strategic elements focused on resource management, crafting, and growth. Players will build and manage their colonies by efficiently handling resources, crafting items, and expanding their settlements. The game features complex mechanics and requires strategic decision-making, testing your patience and planning skills. Prepare for an engaging and challenging experience as you work to ensure the success of your colony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/71682a3ce4c91d054a4441d951bd13c1.avif?t=1733585341\" width=752 height=410 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse yourself in a Winter Wonderland Adventure Game!\u00a0\u2744\ufe0f\ud83c\udf32\ud83c\udfe0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Enchanting Virtual Worlds! \ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfe1\ud83c\udf33\ud83d\udca6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1733585341\" width=600 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1733585341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1733585341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a colony simulator with strategic elements focused on resource management, crafting, and growth. Players will build and manage their colonies by efficiently handling resources, crafting items, and expanding their settlements. The game features complex mechanics and requires strategic decision-making, testing your patience and planning skills. Prepare for an engaging and challenging experience as you work to ensure the success of your colony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157000/extras/71682a3ce4c91d054a4441d951bd13c1.avif?t=1733585341\" width=752 height=410 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse yourself in a Winter Wonderland Adventure Game!\u00a0\u2744\ufe0f\ud83c\udf32\ud83c\udfe0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Enchanting Virtual Worlds! \ud83c\udfae\ud83c\udfe1\ud83c\udf33\ud83d\udca6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A simulation where you build and manage your own successful colony, defending it against enemy attacks. Grow your settlement from scratch by balancing your skills. Perfect your strategy and watch your colony evolve!",
